    "description": {
      "content": "A best-effort OpenAPI 3.1 description of selected endpoints from the Apache\nSolr HTTP API, including the Collections (Cluster/Node Management), Schema,\nand v2 cluster APIs. Solr's full APIs are exposed as v1 (action-style query\nparameters under `/solr/admin/*`) and v2 (resource-style paths under\n`/api/*`). Authentication is optional but BasicAuth is supported when the\nSolr `BasicAuthPlugin` is enabled.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache Solr",
